# Vendored Font Awesome copy inside the archived brand package. Same licensed
# Pro distribution as fontawesome-pro-7.3.1-web/ (also ignored), so it stays out
# of git. The remote design project already has it; to restore it locally for
# previewing that package's cards:
#   mkdir -p "Cube BRAND Design System/vendor/fontawesome"/{css,webfonts}
#   cp fontawesome-pro-7.3.1-web/css/all.min.css "Cube BRAND Design System/vendor/fontawesome/css/"
#   cp fontawesome-pro-7.3.1-web/webfonts/*.woff2 "Cube BRAND Design System/vendor/fontawesome/webfonts/"
